OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine during
OL,6,Fthe evening with some clear spells.
OL,7,FTurning cloudier and windy later in
OL,8,Fthe night, with rain spreading in to
OL,9,Faffect all parts before dawn, with
OL,10,Fsome of this heavy. Temperatures near
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FInitially wet and windy, the
OL,14,Frain persistent and heavy on hills.
OL,15,FEventually drier and brighter as rain
OL,16,Fedges southwards, easing along with
OL,17,Fwinds. Isolated showers following,
OL,18,Fbrightest in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
